  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["2", "20"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "95f9f766-8c6d-465a-922a-cf1d6fed767e"],
 " particles, but the per particle time was increasing by two for each \
doubling of the number of particles.  We estimate this below:"
}], "Text",
