Cell["\<\
The difficulty with the xTanx function is that it is very specific to the \
density and exponent.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.967787329499147*^9, 3.967787361562684*^9}, {
  3.9677874302262983`*^9, 
