Cell["\<\
We can try to make a series and invert that.  Here is a sixth order series \
for xTx[]:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.967274332933384*^9, 
  3.967274352997322*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"14810f28-f874-41fe-bcb7-\
