Cell["\<\
That looked like it worked, but the Root expression is not simple to work \
with.  Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s try a list of equations.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.961691949734439*^9, 3.961691954854328*^9}, {
  3.961692193935598*^9, 3.961692202312418*^9}, {3.961692255932227*^9, 
